    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n45364" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὔτυκτος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τεύχω</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>well-made, well-wrought</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κυνέη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					3.336
				</span></i>
			, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἱμάσθλη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					8.44
				</span></i>
			, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κλισίη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					10.566
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				4.123
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κυνέα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					B.
					17.50
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κρέα εὔ. ποιήσασθαι</span> to
			get meat <i>ready for eating</i>, v.l. in
			<i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				1.119
			</span></i>.</div>
